426 0 obj
<<
/Title (Bag-of-words, for instance, creates embeddings at a document level since it represents the entire document. In contrast, word2vec generates embeddings for words only. Throughout the course, embeddings will take on a central role as they are utilized in many use cases, such as classification , clustering, and semantic search and retrieval-augmented generation, we will take our first deep dive into token embeddings.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 337 0 R
/Prev 425 0 R
>>
